{"id":"n24651-1-8","stage":4,"title":"주거 · 居住","scene":"居住与环境","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n24651-1-8-1","ko":"이 마을에는 나무도 많고 꽃도 많고 참 좋네.","zh":"这个村子树木很多，花朵也很多，真好啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이","meaning":"这，这个","explanation":"이：这，这个。","readings":[{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71687","senseId":"1","lemma":"이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}},{"text":"마을에는","meaning":"村子，村庄","explanation":"마을：村子，村庄；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"마을","audio":"/audio/16a6e53889b32d5b72f4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61099","senseId":"1","lemma":"마을","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"마을에는","audio":"/audio/d92da885f156c9325285.mp3"}},{"text":"나무도","meaning":"树，树木","explanation":"나무：树，树木；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"나무","audio":"/audio/b294b251f77dfbc5ede4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"32750","senseId":"1","lemma":"나무","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나무도","audio":"/audio/bb7cb4cafa8dbb7998ba.mp3"}},{"text":"많고","meaning":"多，丰富，强","explanation":"많다：多，丰富，强；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"많다","audio":"/audio/b30b4bf6ab97d6a55225.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69295","senseId":"1","lemma":"많다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"많고","audio":"/audio/85297c4d772ee0675cf5.mp3"}},{"text":"꽃도","meaning":"花，花朵","explanation":"꽃：花，花朵；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"꽃","audio":"/audio/1543c99e8fd9f44ded8e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62838","senseId":"1","lemma":"꽃","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"꽃도","audio":"/audio/584eecc6a7aa5f280bd1.mp3"}},{"text":"많고","meaning":"多，丰富，强","explanation":"많다：多，丰富，强；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"많다","audio":"/audio/b30b4bf6ab97d6a55225.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69295","senseId":"1","lemma":"많다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"많고","audio":"/audio/85297c4d772ee0675cf5.mp3"}},{"text":"참","meaning":"真，实在，的确","explanation":"참：真，实在，的确。","readings":[{"term":"참","audio":"/audio/8e09b5f4c09195e322ba.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71761","senseId":"1","lemma":"참","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"참","audio":"/audio/8e09b5f4c09195e322ba.mp3"}},{"text":"좋네.","meaning":"好，美，优良，优美","explanation":"좋다：好，美，优良，优美；네：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"좋다","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79033","senseId":"1","lemma":"좋다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"좋네","audio":"/audio/706ff3c687e3893095c5.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"8bafb6b7d17ead49","term":"이","zh":"这，这个","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3","entryId":"71687","definition":"用于指示与话者离得近的物品，或用于指示话者所想的对象。","pronunciation":["이"]},{"id":"16a6e53889b32d5b","term":"마을","zh":"村子，村庄","audio":"/audio/16a6e53889b32d5b72f4.mp3","entryId":"61099","definition":"多户人家聚集生活的地方。","pronunciation":["마을"]},{"id":"b294b251f77dfbc5","term":"나무","zh":"树，树木","audio":"/audio/b294b251f77dfbc5ede4.mp3","entryId":"32750","definition":"拥有坚硬的茎杆，上面长有枝叶的多年生植物。","pronunciation":["나무"]},{"id":"b30b4bf6ab97d6a5","term":"많다","zh":"多，丰富，强","audio":"/audio/b30b4bf6ab97d6a55225.mp3","entryId":"69295","definition":"数、量、程度等超过一定标准。","pronunciation":["만ː타"]},{"id":"1543c99e8fd9f44d","term":"꽃","zh":"花，花朵","audio":"/audio/1543c99e8fd9f44ded8e.mp3","entryId":"62838","definition":"长在植物茎干顶端的一部分，具有特有的模样、颜色和香气；或指会开此物的植物。","pronunciation":["꼳"]},{"id":"8e09b5f4c09195e3","term":"참","zh":"真，实在，的确","audio":"/audio/8e09b5f4c09195e322ba.mp3","entryId":"71761","definition":"毫不违背事实或道理，真正地。","pronunciation":["참"]},{"id":"86d0464f1c6da402","term":"좋다","zh":"好，美，优良，优美","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3","entryId":"79033","definition":"性质或内容等很优秀，让人满意。","pronunciation":["조ː타"]}],"audio":"/aud